    title: "英國醫療軟體業者 Craneware 遭資安入侵，客戶與員工大量資料外洩",
    summary: "英國醫療軟體公司 Craneware 於 7 月 20 日向倫敦證券交易所通報，其部分資料環境遭到非授權存取，導致部分客戶、合作夥伴紀錄以及大量員工資料遭到竊取。Craneware 的業務範圍涵蓋醫療財務、計費與藥局管理軟體，其客戶群體包括超過 2,000 家美國醫院、近 1 萬家診所與零售藥局，顯示此次事件可能對廣泛的醫療產業造成影響。雖然公司尚未透露入侵時間或攻擊者身分，但已表示事件已受控制，外部專家團隊並未發現任何殘留入侵跡象，且其核心營運及服務仍未受影響。目前公司正在持續評估資料竊取範圍，初步判斷多數資料屬於非敏感或已公開監管資訊，並將依規定通知所有受影響的相關組織與個人。",
    tags: ["Craneware", "醫療產業", "資料外洩", "資安事件", "倫敦證券交易所", "醫療軟體"],
    title_en: "UK Medical Software Vendor Craneware Suffers Security Breach, Leading to Massive Data Leak of Client and Employee Information",
    summary_en: "On July 20, UK medical software company Craneware reported to the London Stock Exchange that parts of its data environment were subjected to unauthorized access, resulting in the theft of records belonging to some clients and partners, as well as a large volume of employee data. Craneware's business scope covers medical finance, billing, and pharmacy management software, serving a client base that includes over 2,000 US hospitals, nearly 10,000 clinics, and retail pharmacies. This indicates that the incident could potentially affect the broader healthcare industry. Although the company has not disclosed the time of the intrusion or the attacker's identity, it stated that the incident is under control, and external expert teams have found no residual signs of intrusion, nor has its core operation or service been affected. The company is currently continuing to assess the scope of the data theft, preliminarily determining that most of the data belongs to non-sensitive or already publicly regulated information, and will notify all affected organizations and individuals as required by regulations.",
