    title: "德國與美國聯手瓦解全球性釣魚服務 Kratos，逮捕開發者並沒收伺服器",
    summary: "德國法蘭克福檢察總署（ZIT）和德國聯邦警察（BKA）與美國執法機構合作，成功瓦解了名為 Kratos 的釣魚即服務（PhaaS）平台。BKA稱 Kratos 是全球使用最廣泛的犯罪釣魚服務之一，受害者遍及 35 個國家，尤其在歐洲和美國。該工具包允許駭客創建和管理假冒的 Microsoft 認證頁面，用於竊取電子郵件地址和密碼，從而劫持受害者帳號。這些被盜帳號隨後常被用於進行業務電子郵件詐騙（BEC）、資料竊取和進一步的釣魚攻擊。此次行動沒收了超過 200 台伺服器，並逮捕了技術管理員。執法部門表示，此次行動已阻止了這些釣魚活動的持續進行，並將為後續調查提供大量鑑識證據。",
    tags: ["Kratos", "釣魚服務", "PhaaS", "BKA", "Microsoft 帳號", "網路犯罪"],
    title_en: "Germany and the US Collaborate to Dismantle Global Phishing Service Kratos, Arresting Developers and Seizing Servers",
    summary_en: "The Frankfurt Public Prosecutor's Office (ZIT) and the German Federal Police (BKA) collaborated with US law enforcement agencies to successfully dismantle a phishing-as-a-service (PhaaS) platform named Kratos. The BKA stated that Kratos is one of the most widely used criminal phishing services globally, with victims spanning 35 countries, particularly in Europe and the US. The toolkit allows hackers to create and manage fake Microsoft credential pages used to steal email addresses and passwords, thereby hijacking victim accounts. These stolen accounts are frequently used for Business Email Compromise (BEC), data theft, and further phishing attacks. The operation seized over 200 servers and arrested technical administrators. Law enforcement stated that the action has halted the continuation of these phishing activities and will provide substantial forensic evidence for subsequent investigations.",
    tags_en: ["Kratos", "Phishing Service", "PhaaS", "BKA", "Microsoft Account", "Cybercrime"],
    sources: [
      { name: "BleepingComputer", url: "https://bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/police-dismantle-kratos-phishing-platform-arrest-developer", lang: "EN" }
    ]
