    title: "LG顯示器利用Windows 11功能散播廣告軟體，資安風險警示",
    summary: "本篇報導指出，LG品牌的顯示器在某些情況下，可能利用Windows 11作業系統的特定功能，來載入或展示廣告軟體（adware）。這代表著硬體設備（顯示器）與作業系統（Windows 11）的整合點，可能成為一個潛在的攻擊或廣告展示的向量。雖然文章未提供具體的CVE編號、CVSS分數或受影響的產品版本，但實務影響是使用者可能在不預期的設備上看到廣告內容，或更糟的是，該機制可能被惡意軟體利用來執行未經授權的程式碼。建議使用者留意來自顯示器設備的內容來源，並確保作業系統和設備韌體保持最新，以降低潛在的風險。若發現異常的廣告或系統行為，應立即檢查設備的網路連線與軟體更新狀態。",
    tags: ["LG", "Windows 11", "廣告軟體", "資安風險", "硬體安全", "Adware"],
    title_en: "LG Displays Utilizing Windows 11 Functionality to Disseminate Adware: Cybersecurity Risk Alert",
    summary_en: "This report points out that LG brand displays, under certain circumstances, may utilize specific functionalities of the Windows 11 operating system to load or display adware. This indicates that the integration point between the hardware device (display) and the operating system (Windows 11) could become a potential vector for attacks or ad display. Although the article does not provide specific CVE IDs, CVSS scores, or affected product versions, the practical impact is that users may see ad content on unexpected devices, or worse, this mechanism could be exploited by malware to execute unauthorized code. Users are advised to pay attention to the content source from display devices and ensure that the operating system and device firmware are kept up to date to mitigate potential risks. If abnormal advertisements or system behavior are detected, users should immediately check the device's network connection and software update status.",
