    title: "Apple TestFlight 更新 4.3：為管理大量 Beta 應用程式的用戶新增搜尋功能",
    summary: "Apple 發布 TestFlight 應用程式更新至 4.3 版本，旨在改善使用者管理大量預覽（Beta）應用程式的體驗。本次更新的主要功能是新增了搜尋欄位，在 iPhone 上的底部以及 Mac 上的側邊欄頂部皆可使用。這項功能對於擁有龐大 Beta 應用程式目錄的開發者和測試用戶極具實用性。此外，更新也改善了「先前測試」類別的應用程式展示，可能包含常見的錯誤修復和效能提升。TestFlight 支援於 iPhone、iPad、Mac、Apple Vision Pro 和 Apple TV 等多種 Apple 設備，用戶可透過 App Store 下載更新。本次更新屬於使用者介面（UI/UX）優化，主要提升了應用程式的易用性，並未涉及核心安全漏洞或重大系統變更。",
    tags: ["Apple", "TestFlight", "macOS", "iOS", "Beta 測試", "使用者介面"],
    title_en: "Apple TestFlight Update 4.3: Adds Search Functionality for Users Managing Numerous Beta Applications",
    summary_en: "Apple has released an update to the TestFlight application, version 4.3, aimed at improving the user experience for managing a large number of preview (Beta) applications. The main feature of this update is the addition of a search field, available at the bottom on iPhone and at the top of the sidebar on Mac. This functionality is highly practical for developers and test users who possess extensive directories of Beta applications. Furthermore, the update improves the display of applications in the \"Previously Tested\" category, which may also include common bug fixes and performance enhancements. TestFlight is supported across multiple Apple devices, including iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple Vision Pro, and Apple TV, and users can download the update via the App Store. This update constitutes a User Interface (UI/UX) optimization, primarily enhancing the application's usability, and does not involve core security vulnerabilities or major system changes.",
