    trackers: ["os", "security"],
    category: "Apple",
    title: "Apple 修復 iCloud+「隱藏我的 Email」漏洞，防止實體電子郵件地址外洩",
    summary: "iCloud+ 的「隱藏我的 Email」（Hide My Email）功能，旨在為用戶生成隨機的電子郵件地址，用於保護真實的個人信箱。然而，根據先前報導，此功能存在一個漏洞，可能允許任何人透過該功能，揭露與 Apple 帳號綁定的真實電子郵件地址。此漏洞的發現促使相關法律行動。Apple 已正式確認並宣布，該安全漏洞已於本月透過修補程式修復。Apple 告知相關媒體，已於 7 月 3 日部署修補程式，並聲稱已完全解決此問題。用戶應確保使用最新版本的 iOS 或相關系統，以避免資訊洩露風險。",
    tags: ["Apple", "iCloud+", "Hide My Email", "電子郵件安全", "漏洞修復", "iOS"],
    title_en: "Apple patches iCloud+'s 'Hide My Email' vulnerability to prevent physical email address leakage",
    summary_en: "iCloud+'s 'Hide My Email' feature is designed to generate random email addresses for users, thereby protecting their real personal inbox. However, according to previous reports, this feature contained a vulnerability that could potentially allow anyone to reveal the real email address linked to the Apple account. The discovery of this vulnerability prompted related legal action. Apple has officially confirmed and announced that the security flaw was patched this month. Apple informed the media that the patch was deployed on July 3rd, claiming that the issue has been fully resolved. Users should ensure they are running the latest version of iOS or the relevant system to avoid the risk of information leakage.",
