    title: "Apple 即將推出「Apple Upgrade」租賃計畫，改變裝置購買模式",
    summary: "根據彭博社報導，Apple 將於本月下旬在美國推出全新的「Apple Upgrade」租賃計畫，這被認為是公司銷售裝置模式的重大變革。該服務將結合 Klarna，提供類似訂閱制的購買體驗，涵蓋 iPhone、iPad、Mac 和 Apple Watch 等多種產品。用戶可享受較低的月付金，並擁有靈活的支付選項，例如提前繳清、提早升級或在租期結束時歸還裝置。租期長度不同，iPhone 和 Apple Watch 為 24 個月，Mac 為 36 個月。值得注意的是，Apple Upgrade 不包含 AppleCare 服務，且報導指出 Apple 計劃隨著新服務的推出，逐步停止接受 iPhone Upgrade Program 的新註冊。此計畫預計於七月二十八日啟動，旨在幫助消費者應對近期可能提高的裝置價格。",
    tags: ["Apple", "Apple Upgrade", "租賃計畫", "iPhone", "MacBook", "Klarna"],
    title_en: "Apple to Launch 'Apple Upgrade' Rental Plan, Changing Device Purchase Models",
    summary_en: "According to a report by Bloomberg, Apple plans to launch a brand new 'Apple Upgrade' rental program in the United States late this month, which is considered a major transformation in the company's device sales model. The service will integrate with Klarna, offering a subscription-like purchasing experience that covers various products, including iPhone, iPad, Mac, and Apple Watch. Users can benefit from lower monthly payments and flexible payment options, such as early full payment, early upgrade, or returning the device at the end of the lease term. The lease terms vary: iPhone and Apple Watch will have a 24-month term, while Mac will have a 36-month term. Notably, Apple Upgrade does not include AppleCare service, and the report indicates that Apple plans to gradually stop accepting new registrations for the iPhone Upgrade Program with the launch of the new service. This plan is expected to start on July 28th, aiming to help consumers cope with potentially rising device prices.",
