    title: "Google AppFunctions 提升 Android 應用程式智能性：實現背景代理式操作",
    summary: "本文介紹 Android 系統新功能 AppFunctions，旨在將傳統的行動 UI 應用程式轉型為具備智能、代理式（agentic）體驗的應用。AppFunctions 允許一個特權代理（privileged agent）在背景存取應用程式功能，無需使用者手動操作，特別適用於使用者正在駕駛、行走或多工處理時。作者以旅行規劃 App「JetPacker」為例，展示了如何整合此功能。透過 AppFunctions，開發者可以提供如 `addExpense`、`getExpenses`（用於背景記錄開支）和 `getItinerary`、`addItineraryEvent`（用於查詢行程）等功能。實務上，使用者只需透過語音或文字指令，代理即可自動執行複雜的多步驟任務，例如「為巴黎行程新增一筆五美元咖啡開支」，從而大幅簡化了用戶體驗，提升了應用程式的實用性。",
    tags: ["Android", "AppFunctions", "JetPacker", "智能應用", "代理式AI", "Google"],
    title_en: "Google AppFunctions Enhances Android App Intelligence: Enabling Background Agentic Operations",
    summary_en: "This article introduces AppFunctions, a new Android system feature designed to transform traditional mobile UI applications into intelligent, agentic experiences. AppFunctions allows a privileged agent to access application functionalities in the background without requiring manual user interaction, which is particularly useful when the user is driving, walking, or multitasking. Using the travel planning app \"JetPacker\" as an example, the author demonstrates how to integrate this feature. Through AppFunctions, developers can provide functions such as `addExpense` and `getExpenses` (for background expense logging), and `getItinerary` and `addItineraryEvent` (for querying itineraries). In practice, users can simply issue voice or text commands, and the agent can automatically execute complex multi-step tasks, such as \"add a five-dollar coffee expense to the Paris itinerary,\" thereby significantly simplifying the user experience and enhancing the application's utility.",
    tags_en: ["Android", "AppFunctions", "JetPacker", "Intelligent App", "Agentic AI", "Google"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Android Developers Blog", url: "https://android-developers.googleblog.com/2026/07/build-intelligent-android-apps-appfunctions.html", lang: "EN" }
    ]
