    summary: "本文介紹了Google開發的技術展示應用Jetpacker，該應用旨在展示如何構建具備個性化、智慧和代理（agentic）體驗的Android應用。文章重點介紹了在Android開發中處理生成式AI（GenAI）功能的架構選擇，包括本地端（On-device）和雲端混合推理。Jetpacker利用了ML Kit GenAI APIs，在本地設備上實現了多項功能：包括將複雜行程表轉化為簡潔的行程總覽、從收據圖片自動提取結構化費用數據，以及錄音備忘錄的轉錄與分類。選擇本地推理的主要優勢包括：無需額外雲端費用、不受網路連線限制，以及最重要的——確保所有私密資訊在設備本地處理，不會上傳至雲端。這為開發者提供了在注重隱私和離線能力場景下的實用解決方案。",
    tags: ["Android", "Jetpacker", "ML Kit GenAI", "On-device Inference", "生成式AI", "Android開發"],
    title_en: "Google Jetpacker Demonstration: Building Smart Android Applications with ML Kit GenAI, Emphasizing On-device and Hybrid Cloud Inference",
    summary_en: "This article introduces Jetpacker, a technical demonstration application developed by Google. The application aims to showcase how to build Android applications with personalized, intelligent, and agentic experiences. The article focuses on architectural choices for handling Generative AI (GenAI) features in Android development, including local (On-device) and hybrid cloud inference. Jetpacker utilizes ML Kit GenAI APIs to implement multiple functions on the local device: including transforming complex itineraries into simplified overviews, automatically extracting structured expense data from receipt images, and transcribing and classifying voice memos. The main advantages of choosing local inference include: eliminating additional cloud costs, being independent of network connectivity, and most importantly—ensuring that all private information is processed locally on the device and is not uploaded to the cloud. This provides developers with practical solutions for scenarios that prioritize privacy and offline capability.",
    tags_en: ["Android", "Jetpacker", "ML Kit GenAI", "On-device Inference", "Generative AI", "Android Development"],
