    category: "前瞻技術",
    title: "Google DeepMind發布Gemini 3.5 Flash Cyber：專用AI模型協助發現與修補程式漏洞",
    summary: "Google DeepMind宣布推出Gemini 3.5 Flash Cyber，這是一個建立在3.5 Flash基礎上的專業人工智慧模型。該模型專為快速、高效地發現、驗證和修補軟體漏洞而設計。它將透過CodeMender，一個於2025年10月推出的AI漏洞發現與修補代理，在有限存取試點計畫中，獨家提供給政府和信任合作夥伴。DeepMind強調，由於這項技術的雙重用途性質，其部署將嚴格控制，以防止濫用。在內部評估中，3.5 Flash Cyber在發現程式碼庫新漏洞方面，表現優於Gemini 3.5 Flash、3.6 Flash，甚至超越Anthropic Claude Opus 4.6。例如，在V8 JavaScript Engine的測試中，它發現了更多獨特的漏洞。此外，該模型還展示了繞過ASLR和W^X等標準緩解技術的遠端程式碼執行漏洞利用能力。Google也計劃將CodeMender的核心功能，透過Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform提供給更廣泛的客戶。",
    tags: ["Google DeepMind", "Gemini 3.5 Flash Cyber", "CodeMender", "AI 模型", "漏洞修補", "遠端程式碼執行"],
    title_en: "Google DeepMind Releases Gemini 3.5 Flash Cyber: Specialized AI Model to Assist in Vulnerability Discovery and Patching",
    summary_en: "Google DeepMind announced the launch of Gemini 3.5 Flash Cyber, a specialized artificial intelligence model built on the 3.5 Flash foundation. This model is designed for the rapid and efficient discovery, validation, and patching of software vulnerabilities. It will be exclusively provided to government and trusted partners through a limited access pilot program, utilizing CodeMender, an AI vulnerability discovery and patching agent set to launch in October 2025. DeepMind emphasized that due to the dual-use nature of this technology, its deployment will be strictly controlled to prevent misuse. In internal evaluations, 3.5 Flash Cyber demonstrated superior performance in discovering new vulnerabilities in codebases compared to Gemini 3.5 Flash, 3.6 Flash, and even surpassed Anthropic Claude Opus 4.6. For instance, in testing on the V8 JavaScript Engine, it discovered more unique vulnerabilities. Furthermore, the model exhibited the capability to exploit remote code execution vulnerabilities that bypass standard mitigation techniques such as ASLR and W^X. Google also plans to make the core functionalities of CodeMender available to a wider customer base through the Gemini Enterprise Agent Platform.",
    tags_en: ["Google DeepMind", "Gemini 3.5 Flash Cyber", "CodeMender", "AI Model", "Vulnerability Patching", "Remote Code Execution"],
